; Hint directives (Free Pascal's): deprecated ['message'], experimental,
; platform, library and unimplemented on types, constants, typed
; constants, variables, fields, routines, methods and properties: each use
; is warned about (group -Wdeprecated), with a note on the declaration.
; The uses are the ones Free Pascal 3.2.2 reports.
; RUN: %p3 --mode=objfpc -c %S/Inputs/hints/kinds.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:31:6: warning: 'TOld' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:3:3: note: 'TOld' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:31:15: warning: 'TMsg' is deprecated: use TNew [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:4:3: note: 'TMsg' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:31:24: warning: 'TExp' is experimental [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:5:3: note: 'TExp' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:31:33: warning: 'TPlat' is not portable (platform-specific) [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:6:3: note: 'TPlat' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:33:3: warning: 'v' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:19:3: note: 'v' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:33:8: warning: 'K' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:16:3: note: 'K' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:33:12: warning: 'KT' is deprecated: gone [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:17:3: note: 'KT' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:34:3: warning: 'w' is not portable (platform-specific) [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:20:3: note: 'w' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:34:8: warning: 'u' is not implemented [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:21:3: note: 'u' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:34:12: warning: 'l' belongs to a library [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:22:3: note: 'l' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:35:3: warning: 'Old' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:23:1: note: 'Old' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:35:8: warning: 'Old2' is deprecated: use New [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:25:1: note: 'Old2' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:36:3: warning: 'v' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:19:3: note: 'v' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:36:8: warning: 'F' is experimental [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:27:1: note: 'F' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:37:21: warning: 'M' is deprecated: use N [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:9:5: note: 'M' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:37:24: warning: 'v' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:19:3: note: 'v' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:37:31: warning: 'F' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:8:5: note: 'F' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:37:37: warning: 'P' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:10:14: note: 'P' declared here
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:38:5: warning: 'a' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated]
; CHECK:      kinds.pas:13:5: note: 'a' declared here
; CHECK-NOT: [-Wdeprecated]

; Through a unit: a deprecated type, and of two overloads the one called.
; A directive on an implementation only (not on its heading) has no effect.
; RUN: %p3 --mode=objfpc -I %S/Inputs/hints/lib -c %S/Inputs/hints/useslib.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=UNIT %s
; UNIT:      useslib.pas:4:6: warning: 'TLegacy' is deprecated: use TModern [-Wdeprecated]
; UNIT:      oldlib.pas:6:3: note: 'TLegacy' declared here
; UNIT:      useslib.pas:7:3: warning: 'Show' is deprecated: pass integers [-Wdeprecated]
; UNIT:      oldlib.pas:11:1: note: 'Show' declared here
; UNIT-NOT:  warning

; -Wno-deprecated turns them off; -Werror makes them errors.
; RUN: %p3 --mode=objfpc -Wno-deprecated -Wno-unused-variable -c %S/Inputs/hints/kinds.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | count 0
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -Werror -I %S/Inputs/hints/lib -c %S/Inputs/hints/useslib.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=WERROR %s
; WERROR: useslib.pas:4:6: error: 'TLegacy' is deprecated: use TModern [-Wdeprecated]

; The parse tree shows them.
; RUN: %p3 --mode=objfpc --emit-parse-tree %S/Inputs/hints/kinds.pas | FileCheck --check-prefix=TREE %s
; TREE: TypeDecl 'tmsg' deprecated "use TNew" <4:3>
; TREE: ProcedureDecl 'm' deprecated "use N" <9:5>
; TREE: PropertyDecl 'p' read 'f' deprecated <10:14>
; TREE: VarDecl 'kt' deprecated "gone" <17:3>
; TREE: VarDecl 'u' unimplemented <21:3>
